msgid "Activate the China compliance profile before evaluating the closed loop."
msgstr "请先启用中国合规档案，再评估闭环状态。"

msgid "Closed loop blocked: %(stages)s."
msgstr "闭环受阻：%(stages)s。"

msgid "Closed loop gaps: %(stages)s."
msgstr "闭环存在缺口：%(stages)s。"

msgid "Closed loop is ready: data, scan, risk review, remediation, evidence and report controls are aligned."
msgstr "闭环已就绪：数据、扫描、风险复核、整改、证据和报告控制已衔接。"

msgid "Not usable as a compliance conclusion until the China profile is active."
msgstr "中国合规档案启用前，当前结果不能作为合规结论。"

msgid "Complete and activate the China compliance profile first."
msgstr "请先完善并启用中国合规档案。"

msgid "Not usable as a compliance conclusion because controlled accounting/tax data is not ready."
msgstr "受控会计或税务数据尚未就绪，当前结果不能作为合规结论。"

msgid "Not usable as a compliance conclusion because China rule sources or rule governance require attention."
msgstr "中国规则来源或规则治理仍需处理，当前结果不能作为合规结论。"

msgid "Conclusion is limited until China rule source freshness and professional sign-off gaps are reviewed."
msgstr "规则来源时效性和专业签核缺口完成复核前，结论范围受限。"

msgid "Only a limited conclusion is possible because scope, evidence or report limitations exist."
msgstr "存在范围、证据或报告限制，当前只能形成受限结论。"

msgid "Resolve or explicitly document all limitations before final sign-off."
msgstr "最终签核前，请解除全部限制或明确记录限制说明。"

msgid "Conclusion is incomplete until China tax obligation applicability has been reviewed."
msgstr "中国纳税义务适用性完成复核前，当前结论不完整。"

msgid "Conclusion is not current because no completed rule scan is available for this profile."
msgstr "该档案尚无已完成的规则扫描，当前结论不具备时效性。"

msgid "Run and complete a rule scan for the target period."
msgstr "请对目标期间运行并完成规则扫描。"

msgid "Conclusion requires review because unresolved or high-risk findings remain."
msgstr "仍存在未解决或高风险事项，当前结论需要复核。"

msgid "Review risks, quantify tax impact, and create remediation tasks where needed."
msgstr "请复核风险、量化税务影响，并按需创建整改任务。"

msgid "Conclusion requires remediation follow-through before it can support management sign-off."
msgstr "整改闭环完成前，当前结论不能支持管理层签核。"

msgid "Complete open remediation tasks and verify them with evidence."
msgstr "请完成未关闭整改任务，并使用证据验证整改结果。"

msgid "Conclusion is waiting for remediation verification rescans."
msgstr "当前结论正在等待整改验证复扫。"

msgid "Conclusion is not yet packaged as an issued formal compliance report."
msgstr "当前结论尚未形成已签发的正式合规报告。"

msgid "Generate and issue the formal China compliance report after review gates pass."
msgstr "通过全部复核关口后，请生成并签发中国正式合规报告。"

msgid "Conclusion is not fully supportable until evidence is attached and verified."
msgstr "证据完成关联和验证前，当前结论缺少充分支撑。"

msgid "Verify supporting evidence for the report, risks, remediation and filing archives."
msgstr "请验证报告、风险、整改和申报缴款档案的支持性证据。"

msgid "AI guidance is available only as controlled assistance and still has limited inputs to disclose."
msgstr "AI 指引仅作为受控辅助使用，且仍有输入限制需要披露。"

msgid "Review AI guidance disclosures before using them in remediation instructions."
msgstr "将 AI 指引用于整改说明前，请先复核相关披露。"

msgid "Conclusion is close but the closed-loop control summary still has open gaps."
msgstr "结论已接近就绪，但闭环控制仍存在未关闭缺口。"

msgid "Ready for management review: data, scan, risk review, remediation, evidence and issued report are aligned."
msgstr "可提交管理层复核：数据、扫描、风险复核、整改、证据和已签发报告已衔接。"

msgid "Keep rules, source references and period data current before the next scan."
msgstr "下次扫描前，请保持规则、依据来源和期间数据为最新状态。"

msgid "Complete and activate the China profile"
msgstr "完善并启用中国合规档案"

msgid "Review China rule source and sign-off basis"
msgstr "复核中国规则来源和签核依据"

msgid "Prepare controlled accounting and tax data"
msgstr "准备受控会计和税务数据"

msgid "Review China tax obligations"
msgstr "复核中国纳税义务"

msgid "Run or review the rule scan"
msgstr "运行或复核规则扫描"

msgid "Review unresolved compliance risks"
msgstr "复核未解决合规风险"

msgid "Work remediation tasks"
msgstr "推进整改任务"

msgid "Verify remediation with rescans"
msgstr "通过复扫验证整改结果"

msgid "Prepare the formal compliance report"
msgstr "准备正式合规报告"

msgid "Verify supporting evidence"
msgstr "验证支持性证据"

msgid "Seal filing and payment archives"
msgstr "封存申报缴款档案"

msgid "Review controlled AI guidance"
msgstr "复核受控 AI 指引"

msgid "Review the ready compliance report package"
msgstr "复核已就绪的合规报告包"

msgid "Risks: %(high)s high / %(total)s total; %(pending)s pending review. Remediation: %(open)s open / %(overdue)s overdue. Closed loop: %(gaps)s gaps; data %(ready)s/%(datasets)s ready."
msgstr "风险：高风险 %(high)s 项 / 共 %(total)s 项，待复核 %(pending)s 项；整改：未完成 %(open)s 项 / 逾期 %(overdue)s 项；闭环：%(gaps)s 个缺口，数据 %(ready)s/%(datasets)s 可扫描。"

msgid "Post Odoo accounting entries for the scanned period before relying on compliance risk results."
msgstr "请先过账扫描期间的 Odoo 会计凭证，再使用合规风险结果。"

msgid "Seed the China candidate obligation list from the compliance profile."
msgstr "请从合规档案生成中国候选纳税义务清单。"

msgid "Review candidate tax obligations, confirm applicability, and link official sources before relying on filing controls."
msgstr "请复核候选纳税义务、确认适用性并关联官方来源，再使用申报控制结论。"

msgid "Obligation applicability has been reviewed; keep sources current and rescan periodically."
msgstr "纳税义务适用性已复核；请保持依据来源有效并定期复扫。"

msgid "No China rule versions are installed or governed yet."
msgstr "尚未安装或治理中国规则版本。"

msgid "Install or seed China rule versions before relying on rule scans."
msgstr "请先安装或生成中国规则版本，再使用规则扫描结论。"

msgid "%(versions)s China rule versions, %(active)s active; %(overdue)s official sources overdue; %(issues)s source monitor issues."
msgstr "中国规则版本 %(versions)s 个，其中 %(active)s 个启用；官方来源逾期 %(overdue)s 个，来源监控异常 %(issues)s 个。"

msgid "Review overdue or changed official sources, update affected rule versions, and rerun scans."
msgstr "请复核逾期或变化的官方来源，更新受影响规则版本并重新扫描。"

msgid "%(versions)s China rule versions, %(active)s active; %(gaps)s governance gaps; %(pending)s pending professional sign-off."
msgstr "中国规则版本 %(versions)s 个，其中 %(active)s 个启用；治理缺口 %(gaps)s 个，待专业签核 %(pending)s 个。"

msgid "Complete source governance, review packets, tests and China tax professional sign-off for rule gaps."
msgstr "请补齐规则缺口的来源治理、复核包、测试和中国财税专业签核。"

msgid "%(versions)s China rule versions, %(active)s active; sources and professional sign-off gates are current."
msgstr "中国规则版本 %(versions)s 个，其中 %(active)s 个启用；来源和专业签核均在有效期内。"

msgid "Keep official source monitoring current and rescan when rules or data change."
msgstr "请持续监控官方来源，并在规则或数据变化后重新扫描。"

msgid "No unresolved China risk currently requires controlled AI guidance."
msgstr "当前没有需要受控 AI 指引的未解决中国合规风险。"

msgid "Regenerate controlled AI guidance for risks whose input facts or remediation state changed."
msgstr "输入事实或整改状态变化后，请重新生成相关风险的受控 AI 指引。"

msgid "Controlled AI guidance is current for all unresolved China risks."
msgstr "全部未解决中国合规风险的受控 AI 指引均为当前有效。"

msgid "Generate controlled AI guidance for remaining unresolved risks and disclose limited inputs."
msgstr "请为其余未解决风险生成受控 AI 指引，并披露输入限制。"

msgid "Generate controlled AI guidance before using the report as a step-by-step remediation playbook."
msgstr "将报告作为分步整改手册前，请先生成受控 AI 指引。"

msgid "Resolve scope, data or evidence limitations before treating remediation rescans as conclusive."
msgstr "解除范围、数据或证据限制后，整改复扫结果方可作为结论依据。"

msgid "Review failed verification rescans, reopen remediation where needed, and rerun the exact-period scan."
msgstr "请复核未通过的验证复扫，按需重新开启整改，并重跑相同期间扫描。"

msgid "Monitor pending verification rescans and attach the resulting assessment to the remediation evidence trail."
msgstr "请跟进待完成验证复扫，并将扫描评估关联至整改证据链。"

msgid "Verified remediation is available for report sign-off; keep evidence and rescan records sealed."
msgstr "整改已通过验证，可用于报告签核；请保持证据和复扫记录封存。"

msgid "Complete remediation tasks, request review, then queue verification rescans."
msgstr "请完成整改任务、提交复核，再安排验证复扫。"

msgid "No remediation rescan has been required yet; run scans and close any confirmed risks through the remediation workflow."
msgstr "当前尚无需要复扫的整改；请持续扫描，并通过整改流程关闭已确认风险。"

msgid "Create controlled filing/payment archives from VAT, CIT and IIT reconciliation runs."
msgstr "请根据增值税、企业所得税和个人所得税勾稽结果建立受控申报缴款档案。"

msgid "Review filing/payment archive integrity and verified evidence before relying on filings."
msgstr "使用申报结果前，请复核申报缴款档案完整性和已验证证据。"

msgid "Controlled filing/payment archive chain is sealed; keep receipts and payment evidence current."
msgstr "受控申报缴款档案链已封存；请持续维护回执和缴款证据。"

msgid "Seal submission and payment evidence for all controlled filing archives."
msgstr "请为全部受控申报档案封存申报和缴款证据。"

msgid "profile is not active"
msgstr "合规档案尚未启用"

msgid "Activate the China compliance profile."
msgstr "请启用中国合规档案。"

msgid "rule basis is blocked"
msgstr "规则依据受阻"

msgid "official source freshness or monitor issue"
msgstr "官方来源时效性或监控异常"

msgid "rule governance or professional sign-off gap"
msgstr "规则治理或专业签核缺口"

msgid "controlled accounting/tax data is not ready"
msgstr "受控会计或税务数据尚未就绪"

msgid "some controlled datasets need review"
msgstr "部分受控数据集需要复核"

msgid "tax obligation applicability not fully reviewed"
msgstr "纳税义务适用性尚未全部复核"

msgid "local jurisdiction coverage is %(state)s"
msgstr "地方辖区覆盖状态为 %(state)s"

msgid "latest report conclusion is %(state)s"
msgstr "最新报告结论状态为 %(state)s"

msgid "cross-border or withholding facts need review"
msgstr "跨境或源泉扣缴事实需要复核"

msgid "controlled AI guidance has limited inputs"
msgstr "受控 AI 指引存在输入限制"

msgid "supporting evidence is not fully verified"
msgstr "支持性证据尚未全部验证"

msgid "Verify supporting evidence before management sign-off."
msgstr "管理层签核前，请验证支持性证据。"

msgid "formal report package is not final"
msgstr "正式报告包尚未定稿"

msgid "Prepare the formal report with explicit limitations and uncertainty disclosure."
msgstr "请准备正式报告，并明确披露限制和不确定性。"

msgid "Explicit limitations: %(reasons)s."
msgstr "明确限制：%(reasons)s。"

msgid "No explicit conclusion limitation is currently recorded."
msgstr "当前未记录明确的结论限制。"

msgid "Uncertainty drivers: %(reasons)s."
msgstr "不确定性来源：%(reasons)s。"

msgid "No open uncertainty driver is currently recorded."
msgstr "当前未记录未关闭的不确定性来源。"

msgid "Keep limitations and uncertainty disclosures current before each report sign-off."
msgstr "每次报告签核前，请更新限制和不确定性披露。"

msgid "Review official source freshness and rule governance before relying on China compliance conclusions."
msgstr "使用中国合规结论前，请复核官方来源时效性和规则治理。"

msgid "Confirm China tax obligation applicability before treating scan results as complete."
msgstr "将扫描结果视为完整结论前，请先确认中国纳税义务适用性。"

msgid "Current closed loop is ready. Historical unresolved findings: %(findings)s; historical blocked tasks: %(tasks)s."
msgstr "当前闭环已就绪。历史未解决风险 %(findings)s 项；历史受阻整改任务 %(tasks)s 项。"

